==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|fr}}, from {{etyl|fro|fr}} {{term|dunc||then|lang=fro}}. Of uncertain and disputed origin. Perhaps an [[apheresis]] of {{etyl|fro|fr}} {{term|adonc|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|la|fr}} {{term||ad-tunc|lang=la}}, or a blend of {{etyl|la|fr}} {{term|dum||while|lang=la}} + {{term|tum|lang=la}}, {{term|tunc||then|lang=la}}. Compare also Italian {{term|dunque|lang=it}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Fr-donc.ogg|audio}}
* {{IPA|/dɔ̃k/|lang=fr}}, {{X-SAMPA|/dO~k/}}
* {{rhymes|dɔ̃|lang=fr}}

